# The license of libredb-platform in the platform profile when tool/studio-dev/platform-license.local does not exist.
# Platform verifies it as LICENSE_MALFORMED, starts in state invalid and adds no seat (docs/studio.md, "Platform").
# Never put a real license here; a license that lists the host localhost goes into the gitignored local file.
PLATFORM_LICENSE=no-license-in-tool-studio-dev
